{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49506","headline":"女冠子 一 · 鹿虔扆","name":"女冠子 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凤楼琪树，惆怅刘郎一去，正春深。\n洞里愁空结，人间信莫寻。\n竹疎斋殿迥，松密醮坛阴。\n倚云低首望，可知心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鹿虔扆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49506.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49506","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}